interpretation:
The deterministic runner observes the Patch 1 six-scenario report. It proves
that a fresh Root-approved informational policy summary can be reused for an
informational answer only, through RootShortcutAllowed and a Root-created
informational reuse artifact. Architect, Executor, and the heavy pipeline are
skipped only for that safe informational case.

The same memory cannot authorize payment, shipment release, ticket purchase,
permission, receipt, ActionCommitPacket, or any real-world action. Stale memory
is context-only. High score without RootShortcutAllowed is blocked. Quarantine
near direct reuse is blocked by the focused Patch 1 model test.

